{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社報道，印度塔塔電子位於泰米爾納德邦的一座工廠發生人員死亡事故。<strong>3名合同工在維護污水處理設施時疑因吸入有毒氣體死亡</strong>，蘋果、塔塔電子及當地政府將對事故展開調查。<strong>該工廠為蘋果iPhone生產零部件</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585782.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.942794+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:11:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"96bd37db671baeb5cdab9c958270668d78b7cda1f712b86830014f6a4081a6eb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}